# Adapted from ntc-templates (Apache-2.0); see NOTICE.md.
Value Required protocol (\S+)
Value Required ip_address (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value Required age (\S+)
Value Required mac_address (\S+)
Value Required entry_type (\S+)
Value interface (\S+)
Value vrf (\S+)

Start
  ^Protocol\s+Address\s+Age\s*\(min\)\s+Hardware Addr\s+Type\s+Interface
  ^${protocol}\s+${ip_address}\s+${age}\s+${mac_address}\s+${entry_type}\s+${interface} -> Record
  ^${protocol}\s+${ip_address}\s+${age}\s+${mac_address}\s+${entry_type} -> Record
  # Capture time-stamp if vty line has command time-stamping turned on
  ^Load\s+for\s+
  ^Time\s+source\s+is
  ^. -> Error
